\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 2305033 (AMR-022-5033). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] W. K. Hayman and E. F. Lingham, Research Problems in Function Theory (2018), arXiv:1809.07200, Chapter 5, Problem 5.33, its update and the preceding shared notation. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.07200}.
